&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend development (Java, Kotlin, or similar JVM languages preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RESTful API design and implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Database design and optimization (MySQL,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aurora)Message queue systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(Kafka)Workflow engines (Activiti BPMN, Temporal)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring and alerting (Grafana, CloudWatch)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Version control&lt;/li&gt;
